ANNOUNCEMENTS/REPORTS/MOTIONS:
Announcement was made of a public hearing to be held November 24, 2008 at 6:00 p.m.
in City Council Chambers to receive comments and input on the proposed sale of surplus city
transit vehicles to other Wyoming governmental entities known as the Tourism Promotion Joint
Powers Board (d/b/a Cheyenne Area Convention and Visitors Bureau) and the Wind River
Transportation Authority.
Announcement was made of the appointment of Marcia Mead to the Art in Public Places
Committee; Wendy Owen and Richard Ammon to the Historic Preservation Board; and Robert
Geringer to the Cheyenne Housing Authority, to be confirmed November 24, 2008.
Announcement was made of the re-appointment of Kimberly Elfering to the Mayor’s
Council for People with Disabilities; Nancy Abraham and Shirley Flynn to the Historic
Preservation Board; and Keith Fox to the Building Code Board of Appeals, to be confirmed
November 24, 2008.
